{"qid": "2wikimqa:aec83da1f2faf6ec8badfd53d632f525c9ef2090d99d1c6c", "question": "Do both Beauty And The Bad Man and Wild Child (Film) films have the directors from the same country?", "answers": ["no"], "status": "ok", "correct": false, "answer": "Based on my searches, here is what I found:\n\n- **Beauty and the Bad Man** (1925) was directed by **William Worthington**. It is described as \"a 1925 American silent Western film\"[1]. William Worthington was an **American** director.\n\n- **Wild Child** (2008) was directed by **Nick Moore**[8]. Nick Moore is a **British** (English) director and editor.\n\n**No, they do not have directors from the same country.** William Worthington was American, while Nick Moore is British.", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search", "entity_relation_lookup"], "latency_ms": 62903.6, "error": ""}
