{"qid": "2wikimqa:57543e0892f90733bf97dc270cdb36eb9bf8e2230940bcb9", "question": "Which film has the director who died first, Tex And The Lord Of The Deep or Henry Goes Arizona?", "answers": ["Henry Goes Arizona"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Based on the knowledge base, I can answer your question:\n\n**Henry Goes Arizona** has the director who died first.\n\nHere's the reasoning:\n- **Tex and the Lord of the Deep** (1985) was directed by **Duccio Tessari**, who died on **September 6, 1994**[11].\n- **Henry Goes Arizona** (1939) was directed by **Edwin L. Marin**, who died on **May 2, 1951**[16].\n\nSince Edwin L. Marin died in 1951 and Duccio Tessari died in 1994, the director of **Henry Goes Arizona** died first.", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 21661.6, "error": ""}
